1
00:00:00,598 --> 00:00:02,798
PENNY:
Hey.

2
00:00:02,801 --> 00:00:04,931
Uh, have you read the online
reviews for this place?

3
00:00:04,936 --> 00:00:05,966
(Stuart:)Eh,

4
00:00:05,971 --> 00:00:06,941
(Stuart:)the Internet's so negative.

5
00:00:06,938 --> 00:00:08,468
(Stuart:)I try to avoid it.

6
00:00:08,473 --> 00:00:09,703
(Penny:)All right, well,
Heather H. says,

7
00:00:09,708 --> 00:00:11,608
"The owner stared at me
the whole time

8
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:14,240
and didn't blink once."

9
00:00:22,653 --> 00:00:24,383
(Penny:)Kelly M. says,

10
00:00:24,389 --> 00:00:27,019
"The creepy guy who runs it
asked me out,

11
00:00:27,025 --> 00:00:30,595
(Penny:)then called himself stupid
before I could say no."

12
00:00:31,629 --> 00:00:34,529
(Penny:)Jessica K.
says,

13
00:00:34,532 --> 00:00:36,962
"I told the weird owner
that I liked his shirt.

14
00:00:36,968 --> 00:00:40,708
(Penny:)He took it off
and gave it to me."

15
00:00:40,705 --> 00:00:44,505
(Stuart:)See? Negative.

16
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:48,410
(Barry:)With your foil extended,

17
00:00:48,413 --> 00:00:51,513
kick your front leg up and
push off with your back leg.

18
00:00:51,516 --> 00:00:53,286
Now you try.

19
00:00:54,051 --> 00:00:56,721
(Howard:)And
again.

20
00:00:56,721 --> 00:00:59,621
(Barry:)And again.

